comments.body:
> Using Mission Raw I get a time out. I still need to look into why

I would assume you have something in there that's not understood on either ArduPilot or MAVSDK's side.

> Can't you compute the ground speed based on the NED velocity vector? :thinking: 

Right, I think:
```
float bearing_deg = tan(speed_x/speed_y) * 180.0f / M_PI;
float ground_speed_m_s = sqrt(speed_x*speed_x + speed_y*speed_y);
```

@JonasVautherin I think it would make sense to add these two fields to the API for velocity NED, so that they are easily accessible.

